\PYG{l+s+sd}{          u\PYGZus{}\PYGZob{}N\PYGZhy{}1\PYGZcb{} = 0, l\PYGZus{}0 = 0. This way the}
\PYG{l+s+sd}{          (l\PYGZus{}i, d\PYGZus{}i, u\PYGZus{}i) are the values}
\PYG{l+s+sd}{          from the i\PYGZhy{}th row.}
